<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to Jan 27 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     319	   10,087	  913</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 16		125	   70</p>
<p>    Breeding females		2		172	   89</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		188     10,279</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  3		 75	    7</p>
<p>    Breeding females	     10		536	   30</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		  9	    6</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    514	    1,982	  328</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
